+## S61–S65 (2026-10-17): SysV by-value aggregate/vector ABI, vector initializers
+
+Base: `ms178/lccc` main a88fb736b (re-checked 2026-10-17, no newer merges).
+
+### Results (all measured against GCC 16.2.0-3 on this tree)
+
+| Gate | Parent tree | Now |
+|---|---|---|
+| `check_sysv_aggregate_abi.py` (186 shapes, 3 legs) | 131/186 lccc→GCC | 186/186 on every leg |
+| `check_vector_arg_forms.py` (1008 checks) | 135/1008 | 1008/1008 |
+| `check_vector_static_init.sh` (vsi.c) | 25 of the first 27 objects wrong | 47/47 at -O0 and -O2 |
+| `check_designator_init.sh` | 14 rows | 24/24 (+10 GCC rows) |
